 153:   -- tab, form feed. `\013` IS THE VERTICAL TAB IN OCTAL and is written that way on purpose:
 154:   -- PostgreSQL's escape-string syntax has no `\v`, and a backslash before an unrecognised letter is
 155:   -- dropped — `E'\v'` is the letter "v", so spelling it that way would have stripped every "v" out
 156:   -- of volunteers' handles instead of stripping whitespace.
